{"segs": ["ZH_T20_1107_001:0478b07_100_96"], "en": "RAḤ YAVĀGĀSAMABHIGALAŚMAŚRURVAKTRACIBUKAṂ GADAYODHIŚYĀMARAṂ JĀNUDEŚE VITATE ŚUKLAKUÑJANA-KAÑJAKE CA. II.250.2 [He has] a beard and mustache as dark as the *śyāma* (black) *abhi-gala* (throat); his chin and mouth are [shaped like] a *vakra-cibuka*; and his knees are extended, white, and like *kuñjana-kañjaka* (white lotuses).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T15:40:14Z"},
